{"id":"407f269dfd66acf3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/630_动态博弈逻辑_Dynamic_Game_Logic.md","title":"630 动态博弈逻辑 Dynamic Game Logic","display":"630_动态博弈逻辑_Dynamic_Game_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。博弈项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gat},\\operatorname{seq},\\operatorname{choice},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{dual},\\operatorname{test}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{gat},\\operatorname{seq},\\operatorname{choice},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{dual},\\operatorname{test}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}\\)</span>。显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma;\\delta,\\quad \\gamma\\cup\\delta,\\quad \\gamma^*,\\quad \\gamma^d,\\quad ?A,\\quad [\\gamma]A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma;\\delta,\\quad \\gamma\\cup\\delta,\\quad \\gamma^*,\\quad \\gamma^d,\\quad ?A,\\quad [\\gamma]A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\neg[\\gamma]\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\neg[\\gamma]\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-博弈项与公式\">2. 博弈项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span> 是同时满足下列条件的最小二元组：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gat}(g)\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\operatorname{gat}(g)\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma;\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma;\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\cup\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma\\cup\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^*\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma^*\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^d\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma^d\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?A\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(?A\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式形成条件为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\([\\gamma]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变元函数满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{630}([\\gamma]A)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{630}([\\gamma]A)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>博弈项自由变元函数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\operatorname{gat}(g))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\operatorname{gat}(g))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma;\\delta)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma;\\delta)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma\\cup\\delta)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma\\cup\\delta)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma^*)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma^*)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma^d)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma^d)=\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(\\gamma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GFV}_{630}(?A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{630}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{630}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{630}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{630}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜命题变元函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{630}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\to\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{630}(E)=p_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{630}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\to\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{630}(E)=p_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:p_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:p_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本语言无绑定命题变元，捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{630}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{630}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{630}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{630}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{630}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{630}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{630}(\\sigma,\\gamma)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{GSub}_{630}(\\sigma,\\gamma)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)\\)</span>，其中扩张同时作用于公式和测试博弈项：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma([\\gamma]A)=[\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)]\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma([\\gamma]A)=[\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)]\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\operatorname{gat}(g))=\\operatorname{gat}(g),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma;\\delta)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma);\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\operatorname{gat}(g))=\\operatorname{gat}(g),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma;\\delta)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma);\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma\\cup\\delta)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)\\cup\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\delta),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma^*)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)^*,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma\\cup\\delta)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)\\cup\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\delta),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma^*)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)^*,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma^d)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)^d,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma^d)=\\widehat\\sigma_G(\\gamma)^d,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma_G(?A)=?\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,630}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,630}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族与动态博弈公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma](A\\to B)\\to([\\gamma]A\\to[\\gamma]B):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma](A\\to B)\\to([\\gamma]A\\to[\\gamma]B):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma;\\delta]A\\leftrightarrow[\\gamma][\\delta]A:\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma;\\delta]A\\leftrightarrow[\\gamma][\\delta]A:\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma\\cup\\delta]A\\leftrightarrow([\\gamma]A\\land[\\delta]A):\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma\\cup\\delta]A\\leftrightarrow([\\gamma]A\\land[\\delta]A):\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{630}=\\{[?A]B\\leftrightarrow(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{630}=\\{[?A]B\\leftrightarrow(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma^d]A\\leftrightarrow\\neg[\\gamma]\\neg A:\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma^d]A\\leftrightarrow\\neg[\\gamma]\\neg A:\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma^*]A\\leftrightarrow(A\\land[\\gamma][\\gamma^*]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{630}=\\{[\\gamma^*]A\\leftrightarrow(A\\land[\\gamma][\\gamma^*]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{630}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{630}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{630}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{630}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{630}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{630}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{630}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{630}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{630}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{630}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{630}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{630}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Test}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Star}^{630}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{630}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{630}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}=\\{((A),[\\gamma]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}=\\{((A),[\\gamma]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land[\\gamma]B)),B\\to[\\gamma^*]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}=\\{((B\\to(A\\land[\\gamma]B)),B\\to[\\gamma^*]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{630}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{630}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{630}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{630}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{630}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{630}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{630}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{630}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{StarInd}^{630}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{630}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{630}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{630}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{630}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{630}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{630}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{630}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{630}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-动态博弈语义\">9. 动态博弈语义</h1>\n<p>动态博弈模型为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(S\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_g\\subseteq S\\times S\">\\(R_g\\subseteq S\\times S\\)</span>。对每个博弈项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 和集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span>，定义盒式谓词变换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,X)\\subseteq S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,X)\\subseteq S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),X)\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R_g\\Rightarrow t\\in X)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),X)\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\forall t\\in S\\ ((s,t)\\in R_g\\Rightarrow t\\in X)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma;\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\delta,X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma;\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\delta,X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma\\cup\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,X)\\cap\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\delta,X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma\\cup\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,X)\\cap\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\delta,X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma^*,X)\n=\n\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n,X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma^*,X)\n=\n\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n,X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中辅助迭代由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,0,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,0,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n+1,X)\n=\nX\\cap\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n,X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n+1,X)\n=\nX\\cap\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,n,X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义。测试项与对偶项解释为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(?A,X)\n=\n(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M})\\cup X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(?A,X)\n=\n(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M})\\cup X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma^d,X)\n=\nS\\setminus\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,S\\setminus X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma^d,X)\n=\nS\\setminus\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,S\\setminus X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{630}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M},\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{630}^{M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M},\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{630}^{M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket[\\gamma]A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket[\\gamma]A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}\n=\n\\operatorname{Box}_{630}^{M}(\\gamma,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,s\\Vdash_{630}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,s\\Vdash_{630}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{630}^{M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{630}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ M,s\\Vdash_{630}B)\\Rightarrow M,s\\Vdash_{630}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{630}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ M,s\\Vdash_{630}B)\\Rightarrow M,s\\Vdash_{630}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>动态博弈逻辑的目标差异是博弈项含测试 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"?A\">\\(?A\\)</span>、重复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^*\">\\(\\gamma^*\\)</span> 与对偶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^d\">\\(\\gamma^d\\)</span>，并且测试项的自由变元和替换依赖其内部公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DGL}_{630}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Game}_{630},\\mathsf{Frm}_{630},\n\\operatorname{GFV}_{630},\\operatorname{FV}_{630},\\operatorname{BV}_{630},\\operatorname{freshP}_{630},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{630},\\operatorname{Sub}_{630},\\operatorname{GSub}_{630},\\equiv_{\\alpha,630},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{630},\\mathsf{Rule}_{630},\\mathsf{Proof}_{630},\\vdash_{630},\\mathsf{Thm}_{630},\n\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630},\\operatorname{Box}_{630},\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{630},\\Vdash_{630},\\models_{630}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DGL}_{630}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Game}_{630},\\mathsf{Frm}_{630},\n\\operatorname{GFV}_{630},\\operatorname{FV}_{630},\\operatorname{BV}_{630},\\operatorname{freshP}_{630},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{630},\\operatorname{Sub}_{630},\\operatorname{GSub}_{630},\\equiv_{\\alpha,630},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{630},\\mathsf{Rule}_{630},\\mathsf{Proof}_{630},\\vdash_{630},\\mathsf{Thm}_{630},\n\\mathsf{DGLMod}_{630},\\operatorname{Box}_{630},\\operatorname{IterBox}_{630},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{630},\\Vdash_{630},\\models_{630}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由动态博弈项、模态公式、公理、证明关系以及状态变换语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性、游戏求解或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-博弈项与公式","text":"2. 博弈项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-动态博弈语义","text":"9. 动态博弈语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{gat},\\operatorname{seq},\\operatorname{choice},\\operatorname{star},\\operatorname{dual},\\operatorname{test}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma;\\delta,\\quad \\gamma\\cup\\delta,\\quad \\gamma^*,\\quad \\gamma^d,\\quad ?A,\\quad [\\gamma]A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\neg[\\gamma]\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Game}_{630}","display":false},{"tex":"\\math